          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sheaf+of+spectra"} sheaf of spectra
            on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/site"} site
            of all
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifolds"} smooth manifolds
            may be thought of as a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectrum"} spectrum
            equipped with generalized
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+structure"} smooth structure
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-sheaf"} (∞,1)-sheaf
            on this site may be thought of as a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+%E2%88%9E-groupoid"} smooth ∞-groupoid
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} stable (∞,1)-category
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi Sh
                    %mn ∞
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi SmoothMfd
                  %mo ,
                  %mi Spectra
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo ≃
                  %mi Stab
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %msub
                    %mi Sh
                    %mn ∞
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi SmoothMfd
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo =
                  %mi Stab
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi Smooth
                  %mn ∞
                  %mi Grpd
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  Sh_\infty(SmoothMfd, Spectra)
                  \\simeq
                  Stab(Sh_\infty(SmoothMfd))
                  \=
                  Stab(Smooth \infty Grpd)
          %p
            which is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stabilization"} stabilization
            of that of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+%E2%88%9E-groupoids"} smooth ∞-groupoids
            as being the
            = succeed "-category" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn ∞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
            = succeed "," do
              %em smooth spectra
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stable+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category+of+spectra"} stable (∞,1)-category of spectra
            itself is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/stabilization"} stabilization
            of that of bare
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-groupoids"} ∞-groupoids
          %p
            Together with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+%E2%88%9E-groupoids"} smooth ∞-groupoids
            smooth spectra sit inside the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+cohesive+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} tangent cohesive (∞,1)-topos
            over smooth manifolds. By the discussion
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "tangent+cohesive+∞-topos#CohesiveAndDifferentialRefinement"} there
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+cohomology+diagram"} differential cohomology diagram
            which exhibits it (
            %a{:href => "#BunkeNikolausVoelkl13"}> Bunke-Nikolaus-Völkl 13
            ) as the moduli of a generalized
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+cohomology"} differential cohomology
            theory (in generalization of how every ordinary spectrum, via the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Brown+representability+theorem"} Brown representability theorem
            = succeed ")." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+%28Eilenberg-Steenrod%29+cohomology+theory"} generalized (Eilenberg-Steenrod) cohomology theory
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#FromChainComplexesOfSmoothModules From chain complexes of smooth modules
          .num_defn
            %h6#definition Definition
            %p Write
            %ul
              %li
                %p
